sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant SIM as simulator
  participant MQ as RabbitMQ
  participant TEL as telemetry
  participant SCH as scheduler
  participant WL as workload
  participant COOL as cooling
  SIM->>MQ: telemetry.rack.reading every 2 s
  MQ->>TEL: deliver reading
  TEL->>TEL: store, update forecast for 60 s ahead
  TEL->>MQ: thermal.alert.raised WARNING PREDICTED
  par scheduler path
    MQ->>SCH: alert
    SCH->>TEL: GET /internal/telemetry/racks/latest
    SCH->>WL: GET /internal/workloads for the hot rack
    SCH->>SCH: choose LOW priority job and cool destination
    SCH->>WL: PUT /internal/workloads/17/assignment
    WL->>MQ: workload.assigned R23 to R41
  and cooling path
    MQ->>COOL: alert
    COOL->>MQ: cooling.unit.state Z2 output 100 percent
  end
  MQ->>SIM: workload.assigned and cooling.unit.state
  SIM->>SIM: heat moves, cooling effect changes
  SIM->>MQ: telemetry.rack.reading R23 temperature falling
  TEL->>MQ: thermal.alert.cleared